// # Catalog Docs Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the user-facing docs for the public catalog.
//
// Setup: RFC-0005. Website Source: openOODA/catalog/docs/.
//        They travel with this repo.
//
// Beats:
//   1. CATALOG.oot — name|version|caps|deps|sha lines.
//   2. HOST.oot — catalog.openooda.org file URLs.
//   3. ADDING.oot — how to add a package folder.
//
// Companion documents below are read as text, never imported as code:
// .oot files are markdown and fail the .oo lexer by design.
//   docs/CATALOG.oot, docs/HOST.oot, docs/ADDING.oot
